   "missable": false,
   "stage": 2,
   "guide": "The hardest trophy (PowerPyx rates the whole set 4/10, and this is the grind). The checklist unlocks after the story under Progress > Stats > 100% Completion, but progress made during the story already counts. It is lenient — closer to 60% true completion: any 100 optional missions, 300 of 397 stunts, 200 of 277 base-model vehicles scanned, 100 of 255 animals studied, 70 of 80 challenges, 15 of 18 meditations, plus all robberies, shooting ranges, drone races and target decks. Nothing on it is missable, so work through it in free-roam after the credits.",
   "source": "PowerPyx — GTA 6 Trophy Guide & Roadmap",
