   "description": "Meditate at every spot across Leonida.",
   "grade": "bronze",
   "hidden": false,
   "kind": ["activities", "missable", "collectibles"],
   "missable": true,
   "stage": 1,
   "guide": "POTENTIALLY MISSABLE — the only trophy PowerPyx flags. There are 18 meditations across 10 spots; meditating with both Jason and Lucia at a spot counts +2, and the 100% checklist only needs 15 of 18. The catch is the first one: in Chapter 1, the morning after the main mission Down to Earth, talk to Lucia in the kitchen at Jason's house — she says she is going to meditate, walks to the balcony, and you must follow her and choose Accept. After Chapter 1 that session is gone for good, and it is still unconfirmed whether it is required for the trophy, so do it to be safe. Track your count under Progress > Collections > Exploration > Meditations. The final spot (Mount Kalaga's stone circle) only appears after the other spots are done, and needs both characters playable (after Chapter 2's Coffee Break).",
   "source": "PowerPyx — All Meditation Spot Locations",
   "source_url": "https://www.powerpyx.com/gta-6-all-meditation-spot-locations/"
  },
